rs join up into constellations, and missing a night never undoes one. Twenty puzzles, five at each difficulty from Easy to Expert, all solvable by logic alone. Every world and every coat, the radio and the weather mixer. Achievements come with the full game. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691778","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4931970-1845383656394650","game_id":"steam-4931970","kind":"announcement","title":"A new world for autumn: Ginkgo Moon","summary":"Autumn has reached the observatory. MoonDoku’s tenth world is Ginkgo Moon: a mountain lake at moonrise, framed by two old ginkgo trees in full gold. Outside the window A quiet view to solve against: a stone lantern on the bank, lit windows across the water and the moon’s path on the lake. Slow, small motion: ginkgo leaves drift down, the treetops stir in the wind, the lake ripples and the far windows flicker. The falling leaves fade across the middle of the screen, where your board sits. Free, l","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T21:12:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394650","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:09:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4931970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4931970":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4931970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:35:04Z"},"4932530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-1